[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、見て！\u3000珍しい形の貝よ！\n何か素材に使えるかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Look at this! What an unusual shell! I wonder if we could use it as a material for something?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう。確かにこれは興味深い。\nもう複数枚持ち帰っておくか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. This is quite fascinating. We should take several of these back with us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さっきまで怖がっていたのに、\nもうはしゃいでいるのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were terrified just a moment ago, and now you seem like you're enjoying yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって何も出てこないんだもん。\nきっとリラが感じた何かは気のせいだったのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, nothing's showed up in the end! Whatever you sensed earlier was probably just your imagination."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに観光ができなくなっちゃった分、\n別のところで楽しまないと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, since we can't do any sightseeing, we've got to find something fun somehow!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ……どうして錬金術士というのは皆こうなんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sigh... Why are all alchemists like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい、気を付けろ。その服であまりはしゃぐと\n着崩れするぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, be careful. If you move around too roughly, you'll mess up your yukata."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、そうだった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……さて、貝は集まった。しかし、島に関する情報は\nこのまま海辺を調べていても手に入らなそうだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Well, we've gathered some shells. But we're not going to learn anything about the island just by searching along the shore."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。それじゃ、島の中のほうへ行ってみる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're right. Should we head further inland?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだな……っ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... Wait!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……やはり。何かに見られている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Just as I thought. Something's watching us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え！？\u3000もしかして、妖怪！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! You mean the spirits?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仕掛けてきそうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you think they'll attack?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のところは、まだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not yet, it seems."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……リラ、戦いに備えておけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Lila, be ready for a fight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "言われるまでもない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You don't need to tell me that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、早く行こう！\u3000襲われる前に！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "L-let's get out of here! Before they attack!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あのおなご、先程こちらを見たでござるか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Did that woman just look right at us?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。胸がどきどきしているね。\nあんな美人に睨まれるなんて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She did. My heart's racing. Being glared at by such a beauty..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "馬鹿なことを言うでない！\n……あやつらは油断ならぬ相手。注意されたし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't be an fool! ...Those three are not to be underestimated. Stay alert."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう一人の子も魅力的だ。\nお近づきになるためにも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The other girl's quite charming too. Maybe I should introduce myself..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そろそろ仕掛けるとしよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Time to make our move."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]